Better Aiko
https://github.com/Gitguy268/better-aiko

This is a fork of Aiko by Tw93 (https://github.com/tw93/aiko). Upstream has
no LICENSE file; its README states "MIT License", and this fork relies on that
statement.

Third-party material (outside the MIT grant)
--------------------------------------------
- Upstream's README says its icons were "inspired by OpenAI's original icon
  assets", and many of the upstream glyphs appear to be derived from icons in
  OpenAI's ChatGPT interface. Any rights OpenAI holds in those designs are not
  granted by this project's licence.
- The OpenAI logo (symbol "c158a9", and any other brand marks in the sprite) is
  a trademark of OpenAI. It is included only because upstream includes it.
- The Y Combinator mark (symbol "abb4e6") is a trademark of Y Combinator.

Better Aiko is not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI, Y Combinator or Tw93.

Icons added by this fork
------------------------
The sources in icons-src/ and the symbols built from them are original work by
Lucas Van De Weerd under the MIT licence. Some of them reuse upstream outlines
(file, folder, cloud, message, shield, wrench, globe, bell, search), so the
notes above apply to those shared shapes too.

